        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Plain woven pink silk, with white silk supplementary weft. Brocaded in 13 colours, with complex binding within the brocading.\nSelvedges : pale blue stripe, white stripe, pink and blue cords (right, blue cords (left)."@en ;
